       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SABEXCPT.
       AUTHOR.        BRUCE GEISER.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  SEPTEMBER 2003.

      *@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@
      *@@        ----- THIS PROGRAM IS NO LONGER USED -----
      *@@ IT HAS BEEN REPLACED BY THE REASON CODE SELECTION PROGRAM
      *@@ (SRSNCDPF) IN ORDER TO STANDARDIZE THE REASON CODE VALUES
      *@@ USED IN CATALOG EXCEPTION PROCESSING.
      *@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@

      ***************************************************************
      *  SABEXCPT - CAPTURE ARIBA NON-COMPLIANCE REASON DATA        *
      *                                                             *
      *     THIS SUB-PROGRAM IS CALLED WHENEVER THE LOWEST AVAILABLE*
      *     PRICE IS NOT SELECTED FROM THE ARIBA CATALOG. A REASON  *
      *     CODE WILL BE CAPTURED FOR PURCHASING IN AKRON.          *
      *-------------------------------------------------------------*
      * MAINTENANCE LOG                                             *
      *-------------------------------------------------------------*
      * MM/DD/YYYY  PGMR                VERSION - V02               *
      *  DESC                                                       *
      ***************************************************************

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. AS400.

       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.

       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZABEXCPT-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC                   PIC X(2000).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       COPY DISPDATA   OF COPYLIB.
       COPY IOFEEDBACK OF COPYLIB.
       COPY VCOMLINK   OF COPYLIB.

       01  WS-PGM-VERSION                PIC X(10)
                                         VALUE "SABEXCPT01".

       01  WS-EDIT-CHECK                 PIC X(01).
           88  EDITS-OK                  VALUE "Y".

       01  WS-SCREEN.
           05  DISP-PGM-VERSION          PIC X(10).
           05  DISP-REASON-CODE          PIC X(04).
           05  DISP-REASON-TEXT          PIC X(74).
           05  DISP-MESSAGE-LINE         PIC X(70).

      ***************************************
      *     L I N K A G E  S E C T I O N    *
      ***************************************
       LINKAGE SECTION.

       01  PASS-REASON-CODE              PIC X(04).
       01  PASS-REASON-TEXT              PIC X(74).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION  USING PASS-REASON-CODE
                                 PASS-REASON-TEXT.

       START-PROGRAM.

           PERFORM 1-HOUSEKEEPING.

           PERFORM 6-MAIN UNTIL EDITS-OK.

           MOVE DISP-REASON-CODE TO PASS-REASON-CODE.
           MOVE DISP-REASON-TEXT TO PASS-REASON-TEXT.
           PERFORM 2-END-OF-JOB.

       1-HOUSEKEEPING.
           MOVE "FEXPRESN"       TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE "N"              TO WS-EDIT-CHECK.
           MOVE ZEROS            TO DISPLAY-STATUS.
           MOVE SPACES           TO WS-SCREEN.
           MOVE WS-PGM-VERSION   TO DISP-PGM-VERSION.
           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE.

       2-END-OF-JOB.
           CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE.
           GOBACK.

       6-MAIN.
           MOVE "Y"              TO WS-EDIT-CHECK.
           MOVE WS-SCREEN        TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN.
           PERFORM 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC      TO WS-SCREEN.
           MOVE SPACES           TO DISP-MESSAGE-LINE.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
              MOVE "EXIT"        TO DISP-REASON-CODE
                                    DISP-REASON-TEXT.

           IF DISP-REASON-CODE = SPACES
              MOVE "MUST ENTER VALID REASON CODE"
                                 TO DISP-MESSAGE-LINE
              MOVE "N"           TO WS-EDIT-CHECK
           ELSE
               IF DISP-REASON-TEXT = SPACES
                  MOVE "MUST ENTER TEXT DESCRIPTION OF REASON"
                                 TO DISP-MESSAGE-LINE
                  MOVE "N"       TO WS-EDIT-CHECK.

       COPY DISPCALL IN COPYLIB.

